OL,3,GNEWSANew #15.5m car park set to open
OL,4,
OL,5,FA new #15.5m multi-storey car park is
OL,6,Fdue to open next month.
OL,8,FThe 426-space site between Manor Street
OL,9,Fand Hilderthorpe Road in Bridlington
OL,10,Ffeatures a wave pattern to reflect its
OL,11,Fseaside location, East Riding of
OL,12,FYorkshire Council said.
OL,14,FWork included diverting the nearby
OL,15,FGypsey Race stream, which will have a
OL,16,Fgreen space built around it.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
