OL,3,GNEWSANew #15.5m car park set to open
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe council said the car park was
OL,6,Fdesigned to boost the number of
OL,7,Fvisitors to the area and would "relieve
OL,8,Flocal traffic congestion, support local
OL,9,Fbusinesses year-round and be a key
OL,10,Fpiece of the wider town centre
OL,11,Fregeneration strategy".
